{"id":"sanctorale.05-16.german-speaking","source":"santos/santos_may#0516","kind":"sanctoral","items":[{"text":{"*":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"[In den Diözesen deutscher Sprache]"}]]}]},"part":"title","role":"rubric"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"h2","lines":[["16. Mai"],["Hl. Johannes Nepomuk, Priester, Märtyrer"]]}]},"part":"title"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"p","lines":[["Er stammte aus Nepomuk in Böhmen, studierte in Prag, war seit 1370 Kleriker von Prag und später Generalvikar. Dass er Beichtvater der Königin war und als Opfer des Beichtgeheimnisses starb, ergibt sich aus zeitgenössischen Dokumenten nicht. Sein grausamer Tod gehört vielmehr in die Geschichte der Streitigkeiten zwischen König Wenzel und dem Erzbischof von Prag. Dass sich der Generalvikar mit einem Rat oder einer Bitte an die Königin gewandt hat, kann man vermuten. Sicher ist, dass er einen Günstling des Königs exkommunizierte. Er wurde gefoltert und sterbend oder schon tot am 20. März 1393 in die Moldau geworfen. Später wurde er im Veitsdom in Prag beigesetzt."]]}]},"part":"title"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Commune-Texte für Hirten der Kirche:"}],[{"m":"link","t":"1","to":"common.pastors.6"},{"m":"link","t":"2","to":"common.pastors.7"}],[{"m":"rubric","t":", oder Commune-Texte für Märtyrer:"}],[{"m":"link","t":"1","to":"common.martyrs.6"},{"m":"link","t":"2","to":"common.martyrs.7"}],[{"m":"rubric","t":"oder, in der österl. Zeit:"}],[{"m":"link","t":"met","to":"common.martyrs.10"}],[{"m":"rubric","t":"."}]]}]},"part":"title"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Tagesgebet"]]}]},"part":"collect"},{"text":{"*":[{"k":"p","lines":[["Allmächtiger, ewiger Gott, du hast dem heiligen Johannes Nepomuk geholfen, bis zur Hingabe seines Lebens die Rechte der Kirche zu verteidigen. Auf seine Fürbitte hin gib uns den Mut, für Gerechtigkeit und Wahrheit einzutreten. Darum bitten wir durch Jesus Christus."]]}]},"part":"collect"},{"slot":"84","text":{"la":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Præfatio"]]}],"pt-BR":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Prefácio"]]}],"en-US":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Preface"]]}],"es":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Prefacio"]]}],"it":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Prefazio"]]}],"fr":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Préface"]]}],"de":[{"k":"h4","lines":[["Präfation"]]}]},"part":"preface","suggested":true},{"slot":"85","text":{"la":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"De sanctis martyribus"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"... Quóniam beáti mártyris N. pro confessióne...","to":"preface.54"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"... Quóniam tu magnificáris in tuórum...","to":"preface.55"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"pt-BR":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Dos Santos Mártires"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"...O sangue que o Santo Mártir N. derramou...","to":"preface.54"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"...Vós sois exaltado quando celebramos os santos...","to":"preface.55"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"en-US":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"HOLY MARTYRS"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"... For the blood of your blessed...","to":"preface.54"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"... For you are glorified when your Saints...","to":"preface.55"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"es":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Santos Mártires"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"... Porque la sangre del glorioso mártir...","to":"preface.54"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"...Porque tú eres ensalzado en la alabanza de tus santos...","to":"preface.55"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"it":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"DEI MARTIRI"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"... A imitazione del Cristo tuo Figlio...","to":"preface.54"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"fr":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"Des Martyrs"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"... Nous reconnaissons un signe éclatant de ta grâce...","to":"preface.54"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["II ",{"m":"link","t":"... En louant tes saints martyrs,...","to":"preface.55"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}],"de":[{"k":"p","lines":[[{"m":"rubric","t":"MÄRTYRERN"}]],"cls":"indicepref"},{"k":"p","lines":[["I ",{"m":"link","t":"...Im Martyrium des (der) heiligen N. ...","to":"preface.54"}]],"cls":"indicepref"}]},"part":"preface","suggested":true}],"precedence":12.0,"prefaces":["preface.54","preface.55"],"commons":["common.pastors.6","common.pastors.7","common.martyrs.6","common.martyrs.7","common.martyrs.10"],"title":{"*":"Hl. Johannes Nepomuk, Priester, Märtyrer"}}
